From 7d211d68c2f39d3000cf1e8584394228675b0ecc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devesh Rai <devesh.rai@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:57:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 45/46] Android: BACK key, files in the media index, raytrace
 preview, fixes

- BACK in a frame cancels the running tool, else closes the frame (with
  the usual save prompt); the project manager leaves it to Android.
- A thread hands files KiCad writes in the open project, Documents and
  Download to MediaScannerConnection, so other apps' pickers list them
  (a STEP export did not show in another app's importer).
- Raytracing on Android keeps the previous image (preview or background)
  where blocks are not traced yet, instead of black.
- Plot Schematic starts from the editor's colour theme when it has none
  saved (the choice was blank on a fresh install).
- Actions that dereference a string parameter return when run by name
  without one (RunAction over the API crashed).
- kicad_screenshot draws the frame and title strip of dialogs.
- The library tables page wraps its text (wxStaticText::Wrap ignores a
  repeated width, so a reset label stayed unwrapped and was cut off).
- After the setup wizard the project manager is shown maximized again:
  it came up at three quarters of the screen until the next start.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
